      "mergeID": "62f613fa25fbd844a2613ea3",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Virtual Market 2's menu-based local pickup mirror was so useful!  Would love to see one added to the game menu like the camera.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Local pickup mirror from menu",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62df03e2df935044abfe58fc",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I thought that was a great idea! I often use holoport to check on how I'm looking in new worlds (because i like to make sure my shaders aren't doing anything weird). Would be nice to have a pocket mirror like that from the menu, like the camera!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
